      "text": "EX-BOURBON (American white oak, Quercus alba)\n  Most common cask for Scotch\n  Source: bourbon legally requires new oak, so bourbon barrels are available\n          after one use; sold to Scotch industry\n  Character: vanilla, coconut, caramel, lighter spice\n  Size: standard barrel (190L) or hogshead (250L, re-built from barrel staves)"
    },
